#EXTM3U
# Sanitised structural excerpt of an actual captured iplayer master playlist.
# Codec order, bandwidth, resolution and frame rate are preserved.
# All hosts, paths, queries, group identifiers and audio labels are replaced.
# This is a non-playable example; it contains no media or signed playback URLs.
#EXT-X-MEDIA:TYPE=AUDIO,GROUP-ID="audio-1",NAME="Example audio",URI="https://media.example.invalid/audio-1.m3u8"
#EXT-X-MEDIA:TYPE=AUDIO,GROUP-ID="audio-2",NAME="Example audio",URI="https://media.example.invalid/audio-2.m3u8"
#EXT-X-STREAM-INF:BANDWIDTH=349000,CODECS="mp4a.40.5,avc1.42C015",RESOLUTION=384x216,FRAME-RATE=25,AUDIO="audio-1"
https://media.example.invalid/video-1.m3u8
